OL,3,ATeenager's hand blown off during
OL,4,Aconfrontation between France school
OL,5,Aprotesters and police
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 15-year-old boy's hand was blown off
OL,8,Fduring a confrontation between police
OL,9,Fand demonstrators near a school in
OL,10,FFrance, an official has said, as
OL,11,Fstudent protests continue across the
OL,12,Fcountry.
OL,14,FThe "very serious incident" happened in
OL,15,Fthe northern city of Lens on Monday
OL,16,Fmorning, according to the prefect of
OL,17,FPas-de-Calais, Francois-Xavier Lauch.
OL,19,F"The student's life is not in danger,"
OL,20,Fhe said, adding that the teenager was
OL,21,Ftransferred "very quickly" to a
OL,22,Fhospital nearby.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
