OL,3,ASpanish PM Sanchez calls early election
OL,4,Aafter housing protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,7,Fhas called an early election for 29
OL,8,FNovember after recent defeats on
OL,9,Flegislation aimed at addressing the
OL,10,Fcountry's housing crisis.
OL,12,FSpeculation about a snap election had
OL,13,Fbeen building over the weekend after
OL,14,Fparliament rejected two decree laws put
OL,15,Fforward by the minority government to
OL,16,Fprotect tenants in the rental market.
OL,18,FThe eviction of an 87-year-old woman
OL,19,Ffrom her home after she was unable to
OL,20,Fafford a sharp rent rise has sparked
OL,21,Fnationwide protests and increased
OL,22,Fpressure for housing reform.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
